    "scr_dup": "083",
    "tpa_score_new": "<div>\n<div>平時成績：30%&nbsp; 1. 校內語文能力校內檢測(後測)：15%</div>\n\n<div>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 2. 台中教育大學語文檢測：15%</div>\n\n<div>期中成績：40%&nbsp; 1. 〈論語選〉AI深度學習單+ 知識分子報告：25%</div>\n\n<div>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;2. 出席與課堂表現：15%</div>\n\n<div>期末成績：30% &nbsp;1.&shy;授課學習單1分：15%</div>\n\n<div>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;2.期末考試：15%</div>\n</div>\n\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n",
    "tpa_score_new_en": null,
    "course_pol": "1、課堂上不應聊天。\n2、課堂上不應滑手機。\n3、課堂上不應倒頭睡覺。\n4、應準時到課，不應無故缺席。\n5、上課時應攜帶教材。",
    "course_pol_en": null,
    "course_rem": null,
    "course_rem_en": null,
    "ais_meno": "<div>1、作業不得剪貼、抄襲。</div>\n\n<div>2、不得非法影印。</div>\n\n<div>3、凡作業剪貼、抄襲者，給予重寫；不配合者，該作業&ldquo;0&rdquo;分計算。</div>\n\n<div>4、以生成式AI產出文字、圖片以協助作業製作，應予註明。</div>\n\n<div>5、作業中以引用他人創作或研究成果，應予註明。</div>\n",
    "ais_meno_en": null,
    "ilearn_mk": null
  },
